# the text of a request's body: `Buffer.concat(chunks).toString("utf8")`, outside of loops: the Buffer is made by the row of concat and nobody has seen it, so it is as its class makes it:
# its methods are found without a look at the cell and go by their rows; they went by name, through the stub of a call by name into the host's function
